    <mxCell id="notes-text" value="• Laravel, Inertia.js, Fortify and Sanctum remain application components.&#10;• GitHub and SMS / WhatsApp / Expo / Meta remain external integrations.&#10;• Laravel owns relational SQL writes; the AI service uses ChromaDB and SQLite.&#10;• Mount persistent managed disks for the AI data paths. Choose VM SKU/region after memory and GPU sizing.&#10;• Blob Storage needs a compatible Laravel filesystem adapter or SDK integration. Key Vault needs identity/access configuration.&#10;• This is a proposed architecture drawing, not a deployed or fully configured Azure environment." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=0;">
